# Solitaire self test (text shell, NODESK): "solitair -t" replays the scripts of
# user/sol_tscript.inc (tests/solitair_gen.py: won games, refused moves, undo, score and
# checksums) and plays thousands of random moves; about 50 s of emulated time. The output
# after the command is compared with tests/solitair-t.txt.
1500 {esc}
+1500 solitair -t\n
